00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.005
He turned down an opportunity

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.140
to represent Trump

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:27.974
and Ryan Goodman,

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:28.942
the former special counsel

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:29.876
