00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:31.711
So thanks very much to all of you.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:32.645
Ryan, let me start

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:34.414
just with the very basics here.

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.648
Trump being informed

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:38.117
that he's a target of the investigation.

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.252
Obviously, it's a

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.486
I know people are saying,

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.121
okay, sure, we knew that.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.823
But but we didn't know that formally

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.091
and he didn't know that formally.

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:45.792
How significant

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:47.760
is this step procedurally?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.928
Well, at some level it's obvious

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:49.796
because we've all thought

00:03:49.796 --> 00:03:51.297
that that is the case.

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:52.932
And it's the reason, Doctor,

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:54.334
for having a special counsel,

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:55.668
because he was investigating

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:57.437
matters at the heart of Donald Trump.

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:58.972
But it was never stated explicitly

00:03:58.972 --> 00:03:59.806
because it could just be that

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:00.373
he thinks that there's

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:02.108
criminal conduct of classified documents

00:04:02.108 --> 00:04:02.775
being at Mar a Lago.

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:04.344
But who is the target? Right.

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:06.112
The timing of it is suspicious,

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.313
the fact that he is

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:08.715
being told that he is the target

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:10.683
at the end of the investigation.

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:12.018
There's no way he wants to hear that

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:12.752
or his defense counsel

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:13.353
wants to hear that.

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.988
It does suggest

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:15.622
and indictment

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:17.457
is kind of coming down the pike

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:19.492
for that to be told to him at this stage.

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:20.360
And it is told to him

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.194
