00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:30.790
south Florida

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.891
grand jury,

00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:32.725
that that maybe

00:06:32.725 --> 00:06:34.293
the January 6th portion of

